  1417          // materials exported using the FBX SDK have two sets of fields.
  1418          // there are the properties specified in the PropertyTemplate,
  1419          // which are those supported by the modernFBX SDK,
  1420          // and an extra set of properties with simpler names.
  1421          // The extra properties are a legacy material system from pre-2009.
  1422          //
  1423          // In the modern system, each property has "color" and "factor".
  1424          // Generally the interpretation of these seems to be
  1425          // that the colour is multiplied by the factor before use,
  1426          // but this is not always clear-cut.
  1427          //
  1428          // Usually assimp only stores the colour,
